    "body": "@jeremyroman Yes, it seems fine for the other components as `null` is always replaced by `\"*\"` during the component compilation.\r\n\r\nBut should  `processedInit` fields be set to `null` in the first place when [they must be `USVString` ](https://urlpattern.spec.whatwg.org/#dictdef-urlpatterninit). If it's OK to do so for internal structs that are not exposed through the API I think it shouldn't be an issue.\r\n\r\nThis issue is also discussed here https://github.com/whatwg/urlpattern/issues/204#issuecomment-1891552179",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
